  lossSummary: 'Fall or run out of time: materials, food and finds are lost. Gear returns damaged.'
  lossRules: 'If you fall or time runs out, you wake at the Heart Tree. What you carry is lost: materials, food and anything found in the raid. The tools, weapons and packs you bring return damaged and can be repaired at home. Your home remains safe.'
